  "details": "I am aware of the following feature request: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/vrchat-phone-app; however I would like to suggest a slightly different idea:\n\nI often find myself starting VRChat on desktop mode just to see if my friends are online, if so on what map they're on and what map is popular right now / how many people are on map xyz.\n\nBasically I'd suggest recreating the current VRChat menu on mobile, possibly with push notifications whenever you receive an invite.\nAdditionally people should be marked as \"Online on mobile\" when they're on their phone.",
